        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5、【2024年沈阳工业大学1】已知系统为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r(t)=\\sin\\left[e^{2}(t)+e(3-t)\\right]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，证明并判断该系统的线性/非线性、时变/时不变、因果/非因果性质。（关注通信考研小马哥，通信考研不迷路）"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                108,
                813,
                176
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "解\n "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H[a_{1}e_{1}|t|+a_{2}e_{2}|t]=\\sin\\left\\{[ae_{1}|t|+ae_{2}|t]^{2}+[ae_{1}(3-t)+ae_{2}(3-t)]\\right\\}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ①\n "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "a_{1}r_{1}|t|+a_{2}r_{2}|t|=a_{1}\\sin[e_{1}^{2}(t)+e_{1}(3-t)]+a_{2}\\sin[e_{2}^{2}(t)+e_{2}(3-t)]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ②\n "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H[e(t-t))]=\\sin[e(t-t)+e(3-t-t)]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ③\n "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r(t-t)=\\sin[e(t-t)+e(3-(t-t))]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ④\n①≠②，③≠④ 非线性. 时变系式\n令 t<3-t 解  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "t<\\frac{3}{2}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ". 即取 t=1 时\n "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r(1)=\\sin[e^{2}(1)+e(2)]"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 可见响应存在超前激励力故非曝"
                    }
                ]
            },
